                <type>TextNote</type>
                <description><![CDATA[]]></description>
                <text><![CDATA[V_ADC = 1.62 V + 0.213 H(s) v/atten (voltage), 1.62 V + 0.154 H(s) i(mV/A)/1000 (current).  VProbe1 -> AO2 ADCINB2, VProbe2 -> AO1 ADCINA6, CProbe1 -> AO10 ADCINA10, CProbe2 -> AO9 ADCINB0.  Gates: DI1/DI2 Q1/Q2 (leg a, choke), DI3/DI4 Q3/Q4 (neutral).]]></text>
                <widget_settings>
                    <x>16</x>
                    <y>96</y>
